WEBVTT

1
00:00:00.000 --> 00:00:04.855
Verification results become useful when their scope is explicit.

2
00:00:04.855 --> 00:00:08.952
Record the commit, configuration, simulator and tests.

3
00:00:08.952 --> 00:00:13.352
Open the job details rather than relying on a green badge.

4
00:00:13.352 --> 00:00:25.869
A smoke regression can expose basic breakage, but passing it does not establish full functional coverage, production qualification or correctness in your own system.

5
00:00:25.869 --> 00:00:30.497
The tier CI page is a useful starting point for run evidence.

6
00:00:30.497 --> 00:00:37.780
This lesson maps those entry points; it does not claim to have built or qualified the processor.

